Now, about the tuning accuracy.

23
00:01:38,930 --> 00:01:40,950
Here we have the frequency adjustment.

24
00:01:42,690 --> 00:01:48,470
If you just barely touch it and turn it a tiny bit, you can see that the standing wave gets smeared out.

